      "text": "2. Shri Rajiv Gandhi has been sworn-in as the Prime Minister by the President at 5-15 P.M. today, 31st December, 1984, in the Rashtrapati Bhovan. Other Ministers sworn-in by the President at 5-15 P.M. today, the 31st December, 1984 are shown at Annexure 'B'."
